writeMd("in-plain-sight-pida-numbering-resolution-2026-09-06.md", `# In Plain Sight PIDA numbering resolution\n\n> Private owner-review artifact.\n\n## Resolution\n\nThe original *In Plain Sight* report is canonical: the health-authority Public Interest Disclosure Act protection is **recommendation 11**. The current Declaration Act Action 3.07 page's association with recommendation 2 is best recorded as an **apparent current reporting-label error**, not renumbering.\n\n## Evidence\n\n- The [original report](${bcSources[0].url}) assigns the item to recommendation 11.\n- The [2021 government update](${bcSources[3].url}), [24-month report](${bcSources[1].url}) and [2024 Ministry transition binder](${bcSources[4].url}) also map it to recommendation 11.\n- The [current Action 3.07 page](${bcSources[2].url}) labels the item as recommendation 2.\n\nNo authoritative renumbering or cross-recommendation scheme was located. This is a high-confidence source-comparison inference; the government page itself has not been corrected by this project.\n`)
writeMd("saskatoon-coerced-sterilization-accountability-legal-timeline-2026-09-06.md", `# Saskatoon coerced-sterilization accountability and legal timeline\n\n> Private. Patient identities remain excluded.\n\n${bullet(sk.timeline.map(item => `${item.date_or_range} — ${item.title}: ${item.short_description}`))}\n\n## Legal boundaries\n\n- The review findings, patient allegations, apology, health-system response and court procedures are separate stages.\n- The 2025 certification dismissal does not decide individual merits.\n- Bill S-228 is later federal context and is not applied retroactively or treated as a case-specific remedy.\n`)
writeMd("alberta-central-discovery-case-selection-2026-09-06.md", `# Alberta case selection — Red Deer and Central Alberta first\n\n> Private discovery decision.\n\n${abCandidates.map(item => `## ${item.case}\n\nLocation: ${item.location}. Evidence: ${item.evidence_strength}. Accountability depth: ${item.accountability_depth}. Legal/policy depth: ${item.legal_policy_depth}. Implementation evidence: ${item.implementation_evidence}.\n\nDecision: **${item.suitability}** — ${item.reason}\n`).join("\n")}\n## Selection\n\n${ab.alberta_selection.reason_selected}\n`)
